{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Peleg, for in his days the earth was divided.</b> Rashbag says: the early ones, since they used the holy spirit, would name a person after the event; but we, who do not use the holy spirit, name after our ancestors." "<b>Was divided the earth.</b> The lifespans of the people of the earth were divided, for up to Peleg you find the total of years to be four hundred, besides the individual [cases], but from Peleg onward you find only two hundred."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:47.319336616Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}